Subject: [PATCH] feat(video): implement global YouTube featured video overlay
 (3xsvHoYfZGs)

- Configure official YouTube embed with video ID 3xsvHoYfZGs via youtube-nocookie.com
- Add GlobalYouTubeOverlay component with floating, focus/theater, and minimized modes
- Attach overlay to document.body via React portal with coordinated stacking (z-[70] / z-[80])
- Add Watch Featured Video launcher in Navbar and CommandPalette with drt-open-featured-video event
- Enforce strict 11-char ID validation, zero PHI leakage, and clean unmount teardown
- Add comprehensive automated test suite (scripts/test-youtube-popup.ts)
